{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":130857,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2022,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p7eHnuydyPmG4ncpGo2vgNCg6nu.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3119186","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"祖父より休業中のパチンコホール『下町ゴッドヘブン』を引き継ぐこと になった新米店長・東雲ムサシ。だけどその店には、謎の少女が住み着いていた！？果たして、ムサシはパチンコホールを立て直すことができるのか…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xO973DJEXnaey5UMhAw6ebM5uKB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xO973DJEXnaey5UMhAw6ebM5uKB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"3829791","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"店舗再開のため、台の入れ替えをしていたムサシとハナビ の前に現れたのは、なんと、巨大な熊だった。熊にはユニバーサルな波動を発する少女がまたがっていた。少女の正体は？なぜ熊と行動を共にしているのか…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iQnb8EldJLtaYypYjB84DAUDK1P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iQnb8EldJLtaYypYjB84DAUDK1P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"3836368","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"新たな仲間が加わり、明日はいよいよリニューアルオープン当日！団結力を高めるために、ムサシの奢りで浅草で食べ歩きをすることに。そこにはまたしてもユニバーサルな波動を放つお姉さんがいた！彼女は何者なのか…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/65HStrq0uvlm3xhiSkm3NM1ZKtI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/65HStrq0uvlm3xhiSkm3NM1ZKtI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3836369","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"リニューアルオープン当日。開店と同時に、多くのお客様でホールは大盛況。張り切って働くスロ娘たち。能力を最大限発揮してホールを盛り上げる少女もいる一方で…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vgr3xa5Z4Je8Yfw0yAgdOS60xs0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vgr3xa5Z4Je8Yfw0yAgdOS60xs0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3836370","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ある日の昼食休憩時間。お決まりのまかないに不満が爆発する少女たち。それを聞いた妹想いのサンダーは、まかないを作ることを決心。次第に料理はエスカレートしていき…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2AoqbJiRvzk9HXcr1ysZbjMCl5s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2AoqbJiRvzk9HXcr1ysZbjMCl5s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"3836371","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"連日働きづめで倒れそうなムサシを心配したハナビたちは、ムサシを気絶させて無理やり休ませることに。ホールを盛り上げるために張り切るハナビたちのお陰で店はお客様で溢れかえったが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7NbwossW1GkzyfaaTcMjhkVizjL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7NbwossW1GkzyfaaTcMjhkVizjL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"3836372","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"営業停止になってしまった下町ゴッドヘブン。暇なので他店偵察に訪れた店舗で、ハナビとバーサスはパチスロ勝負を行うことに。大量に金色のコインが出る台を選択したハナビは、そのコインを片手に…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9H6698ul7evn36rq36SUSyk6Xnf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9H6698ul7evn36rq36SUSyk6Xnf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"3836373","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"騒ぎから逃げたスロ娘たちが立ち寄ったたこ焼きのフードトラックには、ユニバーサルな波動を発する関西弁の少女がいた。彼女はいったい何者なのか？その背後に現れる影の正体とは…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofng29OUsaJq2jnIjAGFIrGmvrD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ofng29OUsaJq2jnIjAGFIrGmvrD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"3836374","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"タコスロは自らを技術介入系三姉妹と名乗り、2人の姉を連れてくる！長女、次女の正体はなんと…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GNX74s6lmHIaH9umgUImC3idEM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GNX74s6lmHIaH9umgUImC3idEM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"3836375","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"技術介入系三姉妹をホールに連れてきたハナビたち。早速、タコスロはホールの前に店を構える。タダでたこ焼きを食べさせてもらえないことに怒ったハナビは、サンダーたちと屋台を出し、たこ焼き勝負をすることに…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wEjbYUz77SqrdT4RRktptNl5MM7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wEjbYUz77SqrdT4RRktptNl5MM7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"3836376","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついに営業再開の日を迎え、気合が入るムサシ。幼馴染のコジローがホールを訪れたが、彼の経営するホールが何者かに襲撃され休業に追い込まれた様子。原因がわかり始めたムサシは…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mLyhZZ1d3wn5oEBe7JpPwFC2Jyx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mLyhZZ1d3wn5oEBe7JpPwFC2Jyx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"3836377","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"いつもベンチで空を眺めている少年が気になり、話しかけたハナビ。するとその子は、大好きな打ち上げ花火を待っているのだと言う。何やら訳アリの子のためにハナビは打ち上花火をあげようとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sfcdH6DxH5UjVDS3dYrqoeV5xdo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sfcdH6DxH5UjVDS3dYrqoeV5xdo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/130857/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793436931460,"status":"ok","retryCount"